WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.631
Sign in with your company account.

5
00:00:02.631 --> 00:00:07.843
This recording uses fictional records, simulated location and a test camera.

9
00:00:07.843 --> 00:00:09.489
No live work is created.

13
00:00:10.289 --> 00:00:11.482
Select Start work.

17
00:00:11.482 --> 00:00:14.134
Choose your authorised site and service.

21
00:00:14.134 --> 00:00:16.255
No daily assignment is required.

25
00:00:16.255 --> 00:00:21.161
Expand Crew and equipment only when recording a crew or equipment details.

29
00:00:21.961 --> 00:00:24.074
Add before photos before starting.

33
00:00:24.074 --> 00:00:26.435
Use Take photo, then Capture and Keep.

37
00:00:26.435 --> 00:00:30.909
Repeat for more pictures, or choose several files for ordinary evidence.

41
00:00:30.909 --> 00:00:33.830
Snow ruler evidence must use the in-app camera.

45
00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:38.801
Device-saved photos survive a reload; wait for server upload before checking in.

49
00:00:39.601 --> 00:00:44.390
On a personal device, Keep me signed in restores your session after a reload.

53
00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:48.246
Unsent photos are saved on this device under your own account.

57
00:00:48.246 --> 00:00:52.102
Device photos lets you resume a visit or download an original.

61
00:00:52.102 --> 00:00:59.006
Shared devices should not remember sessions; signing out removes your pending device photos after confirmation.

65
00:00:59.806 --> 00:01:01.035
Record snow depth.

69
00:01:01.035 --> 00:01:03.765
Select the ruler photo and enter inches.

73
00:01:03.765 --> 00:01:07.314
Automatic reading is optional and must be confirmed.

77
00:01:07.314 --> 00:01:12.023
Manual entry remains available when automatic reading is unavailable.

81
00:01:12.023 --> 00:01:17.551
This one-inch example selects Below 2 inches and flags the work for both reviews.

85
00:01:17.551 --> 00:01:20.350
It does not create a billing entitlement.

89
00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:24.157
Select Start work and capture a fresh position.

93
00:01:24.157 --> 00:01:29.595
Record attendance only after the correct site and required before evidence are saved.

97
00:01:29.595 --> 00:01:32.730
A typed location does not replace GPS attendance.

101
00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:36.040
One visit can contain several services.

105
00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:37.970
Add sanding to the same visit.

109
00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.930
Record its quantity and completion separately.

113
00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:45.563
Attendance hours are counted once for each worker, not once per service.

117
00:01:46.363 --> 00:01:50.666
Use Report a problem for access, safety, equipment or other issues.

121
00:01:50.666 --> 00:01:53.235
Choose urgency and describe the problem.

125
00:01:53.235 --> 00:01:59.337
Both administrators receive in-app alerts; email requires the configured sender and dispatcher.

129
00:02:00.137 --> 00:02:03.312
Add after-work photos, then select Finish work.

133
00:02:03.312 --> 00:02:07.364
Capture a new checkout location and record any unpaid break.

137
00:02:07.364 --> 00:02:12.228
Original attendance remains unchanged if a later claim needs correction.

141
00:02:13.028 --> 00:02:15.421
Check your recorded hours and submit.

145
00:02:15.421 --> 00:02:19.430
Explain any correction instead of changing original check-ins.

149
00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:22.341
The company reviews first, then NPI verifies.

153
00:02:22.341 --> 00:02:28.161
The displayed one hour forty-five minutes is a training value, not the recording duration.
